 "text": "An a.c. generator is set up so that its coil of wire is perpendicular to the magnetic field. The coil\nof wire is rotated slowly to produce an alternating electromotive force (e.m.f.). A graph of the\ninduced e.m.f. against time is plotted as the coil rotates.\nP\ninduced e.m.f./V\nQ\nS\nO\ntime/s\nR\nWhich section of the graph represents a rotation of three-quarters of a turn?\nA\nOP\nB\nOQ\nC\nOR\nD\nOS",
